{"nodes": [{"id": "design_map_utxowallet_clone_blueprint", "label": "utxoWallet Native Android Clone Blueprint", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Maps every token, component, screen, flow, and configurable of the utxoWallet dapp (source of truth: /Users/eurobuddha/Projects/utxoWallet/index.html v1.0.52) so the APK can be recreated exactly \u2014 cut no corners."}, {"id": "design_map_design_language_toggle", "label": "Runtime Design-Language Toggle (ORIGINAL / CURRENT)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#0", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two switchable design languages chosen in CFG, persisted, applied app-wide via activity recreate(). All view code reads a central Design token object \u2014 never hard-coded colors \u2014 so the toggle is possible."}, {"id": "design_map_original_design_language", "label": "ORIGINAL Design Language (brutalist/terminal)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#0-1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Faithful to the dapp: monospace everywhere, hard 1px borders, 0 radius, uppercase tracked micro-labels, tabular-nums; light and dark sub-modes with constant accent #ff5a1f."}, {"id": "design_map_current_design_language", "label": "CURRENT Design Language (native Material dark)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#0,1.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The existing native look: dark #0A0A0F bg, #15151F cards, accent #F7931A, rounded Material buttons, sans-serif; dark-only."}, {"id": "design_map_design_tokens", "label": "Design Tokens (central Design token object)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "design_map_send_flow", "label": "Send Flow (full transaction construction)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#5.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Core flow: record history \u2192 txncreate \u2192 txninput per coin \u2192 txnoutput recipient(s) \u2192 txnoutput change \u2192 txnsign with txnpostauto/txndelete. 64KB post-size guard with pre-flight estimateTxPowBytes; READ-mode pending sends become awaiting_approval and resume on NEWBLOCK (throttle 2 blocks, expiry 20 blocks)."}, {"id": "design_map_distribute_flow", "label": "Distribute Flow (auto-chained batches)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#5.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Batches of at most 14 address outputs, auto-chained via NEWBLOCK: batch1's change coin funds later batches. Affordability bug fix mandated: reject only if needed > total (strict), needed == total (zero change) must be ALLOWED \u2014 the current code wrongly rejects the equal case."}, {"id": "design_map_split_flow", "label": "Split Flow (2\u201315 equal coins)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#5.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each output = total/n rounded DOWN to token decimals with the last output taking the remainder, sent to N fresh getaddress outputs of the user's own wallet."}, {"id": "design_map_consolidate_flow", "label": "Consolidate Flow (merge coins)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#5.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No selection \u2192 node-native `consolidate tokenid:0x00`; 2+ selected \u2192 manual txncreate merging exactly those coins into one output at a fresh address. Full version offers dry-run preview (spent/created/net) and only posts if it reduces coin count."}, {"id": "design_map_history_sqlite", "label": "Local SQLite Transaction History", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The app keeps its own rich history (internalid, txnid, status, inputs/outputs JSON, changeaddr, burn, postblock) rather than relying on the node's `history` command, enabling resume/re-post/dismiss lifecycle states."}, {"id": "design_map_newblock_event_handling", "label": "NEWBLOCK / NEWBALANCE Event Handling", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NOTIFY events over IPC drive the app: NEWBLOCK updates block number, reloads coins, resumes pending sends, watches confirmations, and resumes distribute jobs; NEWBALANCE triggers a debounced reload."}, {"id": "design_map_minima_command_reference", "label": "Minima Command Reference over MinimaAPI.Command", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "design_map_utxowallet_clone_blueprint", "target": "design_map_design_language_toggle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "DESIGN_MAP.md", "source_location": "DESIGN_MAP.md#0", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "design_map_design_language_toggle", "target": "design_map_original_design_language", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score"